  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE54.31 (SFT exposures: CRE22.68 to CRE22.72)",
      "summary": "CRE54.31 points to CRE22.68-22.72 for the SFT exposure, but those paragraphs cover loan/deposit netting and guarantees; the SFT formula is CRE22.65.",
      "impact": "Position: Account with SFT EBRM 80 and derivative EAD 20, IM 50 posted Reading a: Literal pointers: no SFT EAD rule in CRE22.68-72, the allocation key (80:20) is not computable Reading b: Intended: SFT EAD per CRE22.65, IM split 40/10 Difference: IM allocated to SFTs 40 vs undefined",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
